uess I get to retire in poverty &amp; also age solo with ZERO family to do free care for me.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":305,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1520607135578480640","date":1651375967000,"rawContent":"This only makes lawyers rich &amp; the #MeToo movement isn't done, defamation suits aren't going to silence people","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":306,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1521718617783644163","date":1651640965000,"rawContent":"@nathanjbaker @washingtonpost \"Scales of justice\" could also refer to the entire #MeToo movement which is more explicitly what the op-ed's subject is.\nBut Depp's a pretty vain guy, vanity in stars is sometimes cultivated &amp; it's not always to their advantage.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":307,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1523751561775566848","date":1652125656000,"rawContent":"@akriss253 @quinncy Before I was finally motivated by #MeToo behavior to leave legal practice, the boss from hell had attempted to strangle a coworker (who also happened to be a friend of mine from outside of work) &amp; the office hid it from me successfully for about 2 weeks before a paralegal spilled","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":308,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1524261569491869696","date":1652247252000,"rawContent":"I had a heck of a time explaining to someone who thinks of me as an honorary aunt, how walking out of a #MeToo work situation was so much more worth it than staying, I'm not sure people value their health (mental &amp; physical) as much as they should. He was only counting the lost $","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":309,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1535026110211280919","date":1654813718000,"rawContent":"@5TrackSeattle SO many people are self-medicating in some way (me it was food while I was in a #MeToo environment, I like the boost of caffeine from Coca-Cola from time to time, others go way harder than I do) even without pandemic. And I'm not at all freaked out by death (been present at 2\/3).","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":310,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1536761197332152322","date":1655227395000,"rawContent":"@quinncy Was my ex boss a legal #MeToo drink spiker (at events he would have vodka added to my CocaCola &amp; as a life-long non-drinker I noticed &amp; got them replaced) in White House awaiting election results?\nBecause that's the only logical explanation besides wildly drunk, lying, or both...","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":311,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1538629518478520321","date":1655672838000,"rawContent":"@lcshorten Eh, my experience of practicing law is it's overrated. It was probably better for me in the long run to have been #MeToo ed out of it, or at least for my mental &amp; emotional health.\nMoney &amp; power isn't everything","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":312,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1538635894550319104","date":1655674358000,"rawContent":"@akoukouli People many moons ago were asking me if we were done with #MeToo &amp; as I sadly said back then, we were just getting started.\nI wish I were wrong, but I knew then I wasn't, there's no joy on being right about this prediction","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDO