e pay gap AND fight for an Equal Rights Amendment?","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":316,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1541989251943907329","date":1656473861000,"rawContent":"@gabehudson It's totally typical, same silence on #MeToo. Short of passing an Equal Rights Amendment, I predict little forward progress.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":317,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1546590248385355777","date":1657570824000,"rawContent":"Yeah #MeToo","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":318,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1552148121060253696","date":1658895924000,"rawContent":"@TVMoJoe @Janis_Hirsch It must be nice to never have to face pregnancy or gender discrimination &amp; Shandling's had more than 1 problematic writers rooms with women in them briefly &amp; as tokens before being #MeToo'ed (or worse).\nIt didn't all magically end in the 1980s.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":