rawContent":"Welcome to #MeToo 2.0","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":326,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1574884532192419879","date":1664316707000,"rawContent":"This should be *every* week of the 52 weeks in a year. \nIt's about to be a massive employment law #MeToo thing...","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":327,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1574894611662872593","date":1664319110000,"rawContent":"@BummyThic @CleverHaunts This is about to be #MeToo Part 2","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":328,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1574982900046385152","date":1664340159000,"rawContent":"@themattwalton I think you predicted today's Try Guys mess Matt (I had no idea who they were until today, YouTubers who put basically all their lives out there for monetization, their viewers basically figured out the wife guy was cheating with a lower level employees cast member, #MeToo 2.0","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":329,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1575952505011572738","date":1664571331000,"rawContent":"@lexlanham @aka_akadonblack I left legal practice because my late parents needed care. And it was also a #MeToo workplace environment (only female lawyer &amp; their very 1st). \nNot sure I would want to go back, I would need things to be very very different.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":330,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1575953026556100609","date":1664571455000,"rawContent":"@JohnBoudet @Dee_Camacho @KatWalk1961 @lexlanham Some of us were #MeToo'd out. There's not enough money to tempt me back into that situation, thanks (token chick IP litigator is now how I wanted my career to go)","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":331,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1575969646645170176","date":1664575418000,"rawContent":"@lfonten2 @michaelkwun @DavidWoycechow2 @lexlanham I preferred transactional practice but it was the #MeToo creating culture that made me choose to get out of my firm. Though if there hadn't been harassment I would have had a reckoning over transactional vs. litigation work balance.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":332,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1576346248491458560","date":1664665207000,"rawContent":"My #MeToo firm, no one did anything quickly because the founding &amp; most senior partner (a bully, probably had a Cluster B personality disorder &amp; active alcoholism) would constantly change his mind.\nGlad I got out of there, sad to have trashed my law career but my health matters.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":333,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1578518563286941696","date":1665183127000,"rawContent":"@LizAlps That is very true, it's just frustrating to be 5 years post #MeToo &amp; see this happening in a younger company in what I hope is a newer culture.\nI'm still not convinced it doesn't end in litigation (wronged wife invested in company &amp; worked for them as on camera talent too).","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":334,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1579220367998353409","date":1665350450000,"rawContent":"@quinncy Putting on the lawyer hat (when #MeToo forcibly removed it from my head I can't say I was all that eager to put it back on), this video would make a hell of an exhibit for a jury or judge in a workplace harassment trial. This is what we mean by 'hostile work environment'","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":335,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1581432339829096448","date":1665877826000,"rawContent":"@AlexJWeitzman It doesn't because I was #MeToo ed out of my 1st law job. And then took 12 years off unpaid to give care to my late parents\nI'd call the offer an insult to Ms Taylor (&amp; the union) but it's insulting to legitimate insults (&amp; all hours spent striking &amp;\/or negotiating union minimum)","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":336,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1581726113969360896","date":1665947867000,"rawContent":"Want to know why so many women &amp; children didn't report #MeToo harassment, abuse &amp; violence for so long?\nTale as old as time: DARVO: Deny, Attack, Reverse Victimhood Order\nYou have to be hella strong to stand up to a second round of abuse from an abuser's paid counsel.","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":337,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1582114352542679040","date":1666040430000,"rawContent":"It's really wild to be reviewing this segment as Generation X (or older) person, there was a lot we probably wrote off as 'oh so it's supposed to be a comedy bit' but when viewed through post #MeToo world lens it's several kinds of awful.\nI'm not sure younger generations get this","userId":871858796179673089,"media":null,"username":"ThatVDOVault","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":146,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":338,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]